    <div class="title margin-bottom-100">
      <h2 class="feature-title">The Importance of Tenant Placement</h2>
      <p>At Vancouver Luxury Rentals, we recognize that tenant placement is a critical aspect of our job as property managers. That's why we have developed a meticulous tenant selection and placement process that relies on the expertise of our seasoned property managers and advanced tools. We take pride in our stringent approach to selecting the right tenant for your luxury property, as it ensures the satisfaction of our clients and our team. At Vancouver Luxury Rentals, we prioritize delivering the highest quality service, and our tenant placement process reflects that commitment.

      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="visible-xs">
